  "summary": "KITCHENER, ON, June 24, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Canadian Solar Inc. (the \"Company\" or \" Canadian Solar \") (NASDAQ: CSIQ) today announced that e-STORAGE, its energy storage solutions business, will supply a 75 MW / 381 MWh DC battery energy storage system (BESS) to Apex Clean Energy in Branch County,",
